aa500bvpfov-by-tvt (1.0-0ddebs12) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patches/01_adapt_build.patch : the launcher is a real shell
    script, compiles in a private temporary directory with -std=gnu89
    (GCC 14 and 15 rejected the code), plays the sound with aplay
    instead of /dev/dsp, and runs the intro in its own session
  * debian/patches/02_remove_fullscreen.patch : closing the window quits
    the intro
  * debian/control : Architecture all (the binary is a shell script),
    dropped osspd, osspd-pulseaudio, gzip, coreutils and
    mesa-common-dev, added libc6-dev, libgl-dev, libglu1-mesa-dev,
    alsa-utils and pipewire-alsa, better description
  * debian/resources : real icon (was empty), desktop file runs the
    intro without bash nor terminal
  * debian/aa500bvpfov-by-tvt.lintian-overrides : removed obsolete
    overrides
  * debian/aa500bvpfov-by-tvt.6.md : updated manual

